              <div>Slope % = tan(30°) × 100</div>
              <div>tan(30°) ≈ 0.57735</div>
              <div>Slope % = 0.57735 × 100 ≈ 57.735%</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Example 4 -->
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-2xs dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900 space-y-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              Example 4: Roof Rise = 4 ft, Run = 12 ft
            </h3>
