              <div>Pitch X = (4 / 12) × 12 = 4 ➔ 4:12 pitch</div>
              <div>Slope % = (4 / 12) × 100 = 33.33%</div>
              <div>Roof Angle = arctan(4/12) ≈ 18.435°</div>
              <div>Rafter L = √(4² + 12²) = √160 ≈ 12.649 ft</div>
            </div>
