            </p>
            <div class="rounded-lg bg-slate-50 p-2.5 font-mono dark:bg-slate-950/60 space-y-1">
              <div>Rise = 10 × tan(15°) = 10 × 0.2679 = 2.679 m</div>
              <div>Slope % = tan(15°) × 100 = 26.79%</div>
              <div>Hypotenuse L = √(2.679² + 10²) ≈ 10.353 m</div>
            </div>
