            <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
              A 6:12 roof pitch means the roof ascends 6 inches vertically for every 12 inches (1 foot) of horizontal building run. This equals a 50% slope and an angle of approximately 26.57 degrees.
