          <details class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center justify-between">
              <span>How do I calculate the required horizontal run for a wheelchair ramp?</span>
